<view class="page footer-space">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="topline">
      <view class="badge"><view class="dot"></view><text>高考后决策助手</text></view>
      <text class="top-note">首页</text>
    </view>
    <text class="hero-title">AI 辅助职业选择与志愿填报参考</text>
    <text class="hero-desc">把分数、位次、选科、兴趣和性格转成更清晰的专业与职业方向。</text>
    <view class="process">
      <view class="process-item">
        <text class="process-title">01 输入</text>
        <text class="process-desc">成绩、位次、选科、路径</text>
      </view>
      <view class="process-item">
        <text class="process-title">02 分析</text>
        <text class="process-desc">职业、专业、院校取舍</text>
      </view>
      <view class="process-item">
        <text class="process-title">03 复核</text>
        <text class="process-desc">解锁报告或老师咨询</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="content">
    <button class="primary-btn" bindtap="startAssessment">开始职业与志愿分析</button>

    <view class="section">
      <view class="section-head">
        <text class="section-title">功能入口</text>
        <text class="hint">精简主流程</text>
      </view>
      <view class="feature-grid">
        <view class="feature">
          <text class="feature-title">职业与志愿分析</text>
          <text class="feature-desc">成绩、位次、兴趣、MBTI 与职业路径规划综合分析。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="feature">
          <text class="feature-title">专业方向建议</text>
          <text class="feature-desc">结合选科限制与就业方向，筛出适合的大类。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="feature">
          <text class="feature-title">老师复核咨询</text>
          <text class="feature-desc">复杂志愿表可添加老师 VX 继续判断风险。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="feature">
          <text class="feature-title">历史记录</text>
          <text class="feature-desc">登录后查看报告、订单和解锁状态。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section warn">
      <view class="section-head">
        <text class="section-title">定位说明</text>
        <text class="hint">首屏文案</text>
      </view>
      <text class="paragraph">结果用于职业选择与志愿填报参考，不替代官方招生计划、位次表和专业组规则。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
